agement, internal controls, SAP FICO automation, and large-scale project financing.Over the course of his career, he has served in three major subsidiaries of Coal India BCCL, MCL, and NCL in key leadership roles at Headquarters and operational areas. He holds strong academic and professional credentials, including CMA (Cost & Management Accountant) and MBA (Finance), complemented by advanced trainings in corporate governance, financial management, and strategic leadership.He has played a pivotal role in financial modelling and structuring of several multi-crore expansion and infrastructure projects including Lakhanpur Belpahar Lilari Integrated Project, Jayant Expansion, RLS and Washery Projects, FMC systems, coal handling infrastructure, and major OB removal contracts. His capability to enhance project IRRs, design robust debt-equity structures, and ensure compliance with Ind AS, Companies Act, SEBI, DPE, DIPAM and CIL guidelines is widely acknowledged.","bflag":null,"csvName":null,"desc":"Appointment","difference":"00:00:01","dt":"10022026185645","exchdisstime":"10-Feb-2026 18:56:46","fileSize":"647.95 KB","hasXbrl":true,"old_new":null,"orgid":null,"seq_id":"106528760","smIndustry":null,"sm_isin":"INE05XR01022","sm_name":"Bharat Coking Coal Limited","sort_date":"2026-02-10 18:56:45","symbol":"BHARATCOAL"},{"an_dt":"04-Feb-2026 18:28:43","attFileSize":"3.28 MB","attchmntFile":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BCCL_04022026182826_Newspaper_Publications_Signed.pdf","attchmntText":"Bharat Coking Coal Limited has informed the Exchange about Copy of Newspaper Publication","bflag":null,"csvName":null,"desc":"Copy of Newspaper Publication","difference":"00:00:01","dt":"04022026182843","exchdisstime":"04-Feb-2026 18:28:44","fileSize":"3.28 MB","hasXbrl":true,"old_new":null,"orgid":null,"seq_id":"106520134","smIndustry":null,"sm_isin":"INE05XR01022","sm_name":"Bharat Coking Coal Limited","sort_date":"2026-02-04 18:28:43","symbol":"BHARATCOAL"},{"an_dt":"03-Feb-20